    "summary": "The user is asking for guidance on how to teach a civics class about public health mandates, specifically inquiring whether arguments deemed \"misinformation\" by scientific bodies should be included in a classroom setting. The assistant advises distinguishing between political/constitutional arguments (which are legitimate for debate) and factual scientific claims (which should be addressed with reliable evidence).",
